      "text": {
        "jp": "フィーナが幻獣召喚を覚えました。\r\n\r\n旅の中で幻獣と出会い、力を認められることで\r\n召喚することができるようになります。\r\n\r\n戦闘中に、同時に召喚できる幻獣は1体までです。",
        "official_en": "Fina has learned how to summon espers!\r\n\r\nNew espers can be acquired along your journey,\r\nthough bringing them to heel will require a show of\r\nmight.\r\n\r\nOnly one esper can be summoned to battle at any\r\ngiven time.",
        "real_en": "Fina has learned Eidolon Summoning.\r\n\r\nAs you travel, you may meet Eidolons. If they acknowledge your strength, you will be able to summon them.\r\n\r\nOnly one Eidolon can be summoned in battle at a time."
      },
